description:
Read the raw source of a file on your Nekoweb site (SSI directives in .html files are returned as written, not rendered).

Text files are returned as text, paginated by character offset. Images up to 5.0 MB are returned as images. Other binaries return only their size.

Examples:
  - "Show me my homepage HTML" -> { path: "/mysite.nekoweb.org/index.html" }
  - "Read the rest of the stylesheet" -> { path: "/mysite.nekoweb.org/style.css", offset: 20000 }
